  "description": "ERR-PARTIAL lock: the fixture is opened writable in Workspaces(0) and in a second appended Workspace. Row ID=1 is put in pessimistic Edit in the first (LockEdits True). The second then tries Edit, Value assignment and Update on the same row, and Execute 'UPDATE T SET N = 99 WHERE ID = 1' with dbFailOnError; EditMode, RecordsAffected and Errors are read after each. The first then calls CancelUpdate, the second retries Edit/Update, and the row is read in both.",
